<title>USA: Oryx Technology completes stock placement.</title>
<headline>Oryx Technology completes stock placement.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oryx Technology Corp on Thursday said it completed a private placement of 910,000 unregistered common shares to a European institutional investors, raising net proceeds of just over $1.5 million.</p>
<p>Proceeds are expected to be used to grow Oryx's SurgX unit, develop the DC-to-DC power supply market for its Oryx Power Products unit and continue development of Oryx's TTS 2000 Process Monitoring Tool, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
